{"chunk":"In approving a variance, the Board of Appeal may attach such conditions and safeguards\n               as it deems necessary to assure harmony with the general purposes and intent of this\n               code, such as, but not limited to, the following:\n\n                  (a)\n\n                  a requirement of front, side, and rear yards greater than the minimum required by\n                  this code;\n\n                  (b)\n\n                  requirement of screening of parking areas and other parts of the lot from adjoining\n                  lots or from the street by walls, fences, planting, or other devices;\n\n                  (c)\n\n                  modification of the exterior features or appearance of the structure;\n\n                  (d)\n\n                  limitation of the size, number of occupants, method and time of operation, and extent\n                  of facilities;\n\n                  (e)\n\n                  regulation of number, design, and location of access drives and other traffic features;\n                  and\n\n                  (f)\n\n                  requirement of off-street parking and other special features beyond the minimum required\n                  by this or other applicable codes or regulations.","document":"ARTICLE_7_-_VARIANCES","city":"boston","article":"ARTICLE 7 VARIANCES","section":"Section 7-4. Other Conditions Necessary as Protection.","url":"https:\/\/library.municode.com\/MA\/Boston\/codes\/Redevelopment_Authority?nodeId=ART7VA_S7-4OTCONEPR","district_code":[],"district_category":[],"embedding":[0.0044534048,-0.0225260295,0.0078242756,0.0190747473,-0.0276849661,-0.0266738851,0.0546650328,0.0192613788,-0.0010406189,0.0247992482,0.0302518811,0.0361439586,0.0628907084,-0.0364466794,-0.0079140346,-0.0445732251,0.0247164983,0.0297349468,-0.0002110676,-0.03971944,0.0189060923,-0.0068460959,-0.0498383045,-0.0682279021,-0.0278365575,-0.0352131389,0.018934343,-0.0624381267,-0.013058478,-0.04184957